    <!-- Every two hours, 08:05-18:05, Monday to Friday.
         Six runs rather than eleven. Almost all of a run's cost is fixed
         startup overhead (~47k tokens of CLAUDE.md plus 25 MCP servers
         re-cached each time, about $0.75 of a $0.79 run), and none of that
         can be dropped without losing the Slack plugin's OAuth, which is
         where two of the three cats the schedule caught on day one came
         from. Halving the runs is the only lever that does not cost a
         source. Minute 5 keeps it clear of the sort-downloads cron jobs on
         the hour and half hour. -->
